{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1546,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b447ac3b7a93cb996ff8ff5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "入学前の夏休みは、毎年家族で\r\n高原の別荘に避暑に行ってたな。\r\nテニスやったり湖で泳いだり！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5293d531fdf1dcce40671d7474ad9a5e5c2f8292fb3f3f74a1741ced00a3ea00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c6bf7662fa5f7d9fa8d38d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "モンブラン、ブドウのパルフェ、\r\nスイートポテト…秋のパティスリー\r\nって新作だらけで目移りする…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d237140f200d2c28412feca6c747dcd54234a21806f75d1bc25d701174b2c9ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5708ecaa82ad83e69eb3a3d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒くても換気は小まめに。\r\n埃っぽい部屋は鼻づまりになるから\r\n苦手なんだよね…健康第一だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "019a197d8b93f44e8d41dc893de8f4047cd285fa7a3f873adfd5dc786ebb6260",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4abfb44b75c89c93d163ba4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服、爆発をイメージした\r\nプリントがついてるでしょ？\r\n視界に入るたび気合いが入るんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d58e54f56f699e9d24eb3a120ece40358164d1138e44708583329baa0be35828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebf956151633015e0803cca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やってみせる",
      "source_fingerprint": "57e835c304d749feac53c2c93c044f238781d83979d2b5689e217a20ed7ef6ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f52c820933c9567fdee964c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ベルトはズレないように\r\nキツめに締めてるんだ。その方が\r\n背筋もしゃきっとするしね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a7fb4165a8e515fcaa25fe5e156fe8d3691fe518c42e2a447c60f5d82387ebe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3667ddd06fdfc079d6485e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんなトレーニングもこなすから、\r\n厳しく頼むよ、トレーナーさん。\r\n『私は、次のレースで絶対勝つ！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e3cada28a3792296849374878d5fee4edb21739e90752fcdf1afce79295670b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:126fd213879a7de0447acf74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幼馴染のみんなに負けない…いや、\r\n引っ張っていける自分になるんだ！\r\n私たちが最強だって示すために！",
      "source_fingerprint": "962f17172f58dd284cc057b1c700276a6154db15dd9649e82cda1b4ae15a5bf5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:003758699cce088e88bd5985",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、今日もはじけていこう！\r\nこの脚の爆発力を、\r\nもっともっと鍛えるんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d5339f3a4d66db3195ddfbe48e7c0bf12c1c31a30ac36d8348c5add3dc10a79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8416e9ac23e23f207a0140e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宣言する。\r\n『私はトレーナーさんと共に\r\nレース界に爆風を巻き起こす！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6326ba4f433805546b9c226ed2f1da4625947f0386722751f75d8f9f3b9648",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdd0dbddfe3d0bbb33daafb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いい指導者に巡り合えたなって\r\n思うんだ。誰より私を理解してる。\r\n貴方がいれば、絶対に強くなれる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6280b7b3f157e0e1858b056ce460263ae9c3ebdf3a72b43b621488f5ebfb8354",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e34afffeb3ed69b598920fbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングも遊びも全力で！\r\nせっかくの海だ、\r\n思いきり楽しもうっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6db6658ef4c6b567a5af9eee9b5fa67e8a6b200756e2fb69affee0f37bc12f65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07261514dd9d87ca1c80954",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方となら、夢はどこまでも膨らむ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72d37047a87c37267e52295d31bdc0d05565f20998286105759cd73c6cf540a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dff4f87036258da1abf0455",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挑戦できて、よかった！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a98947ebaed459a8b506be77f92821a96b4686e4da2e033261fd765e26da7dcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f07368a5bdfe0577d9582aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私、やっぱり才能あるかな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f0e02f72a002dfa75475a757d63682b9da2ef0d26ce372d737f0372bd8ab679",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86041b2faf94b6822593ac11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限界の先へ…切り込む！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc3284a7367eb79bd8ca49959d09b36e19e54123c9be22b63f4ae3faaa5311fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eed2675c95d4dbc8ecd9eafc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バブルガムフェローだよ、よろしく。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ba9b0f68a14ff9ee25ae94109ec0b9c5a6a84eae0768eb5f01cfe1889b6095b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbd5a50e09a06e66203aec2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいよ、宣言する！\r\n『絶対に私が勝つ！！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a42ad88387c470ac0dd747dc8bd29e97f6c197f89ae7849e064550f47d6d97b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1124",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e8067d0ec8b0de240f63664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同气相求……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3619ebeaee7233f36e5337abfbf433c87bab1224336e3bb5c33e7903c3aac42a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1126",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6cd4c1a06549123ed416f17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "千年的漫漫长路，愿与你同行……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a269529d46dc52111d44fd4c3c9186ea29eaed54c71633bd8aac2a6b25bf78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1126",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bedece39ae4da1f7e2191e8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "犹如云外苍天般的心境……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ccabb94a72dcfcd6b2aeab46b58613f083248bbdd171110519bf2bcaef1105",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1126",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2139429babf172ff6492b822",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在秋季比赛拉开帷幕的这个时期，\r\n我正在进行细致的巡逻。\r\n因为神经紧绷的学生也会变多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ebe77478433f3dbfa2f69d54ee14dba9eaadeb5f9fe27ebe3d84c85daed5b08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1127",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc2f596a2966772510e6b348",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清扫积雪、向各位老师报告等等……\r\n善后工作花了大半天时间。\r\n雪雕倒塌事件，绝不可饶恕……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "506f5bbe816b84b43d981b67d287f68b959db1eed7755f40c69f031e7d01a583",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1127",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3209fe5e75c33d12097784ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超出期待的惊喜……\r\n说起惊喜的话，果然还是\r\n惊吓魔盒……？不不不不……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b723b5b84f34675a1e185be5ef9f977c5ace84e739c74c635ff2567035c9488",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1127",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f01044e9e695d3d51cf9b93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞老人真是伟大。为所有人送去惊喜与\r\n幸福的存在……本官今晚，\r\n也要成为那样的圣诞老人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d5f3ae67099da0b281fc8647d20b07bcac92c8907e722c6e0b0b1b860b42d88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1127",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a286106fff877a10446a0b22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当我告诉大家我被解除调查任务时，\r\n大家的表情深深印在了我的脑海中……\r\n现在，她们已经能精神满满地笑出来了吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c561a82591decb3c9bd7c7dadc1bc85fca718bbcefc13a8dd45f46b63cc1c31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1127",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddcbe145f283122efc2c3525",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔辗转听到\r\n调查队大家的活跃表现……呵呵，\r\n总觉得既感到自豪，又有点寂寞呢……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a604c2f9c041dbf710b5864ac9c2bed8bbd5017e0830ce27e9213f68175cccab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1127",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9caf7b8e9b93f7e42f6f18b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，要出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "849c0c3b42eb2774cbe0975112a27fbd3b244514467ef4ff9ae527ddc51556b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d533baf38852c1af7010c36f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起出国远征的时候，\n你急忙学了当地的语言吧。\n事出突然，但还是谢谢你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "926cb849aa065c14db9bd3b178ab5edbffef63a2cebdc9f302c9e1cb98ea220f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413682238d200f70fb922624",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd24a1b93aeb74bc0443da46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0911e22207ebd4e5b2465a4d2378a3328e0057ddd0a0764d77344297201735f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bdadc1934d653abe5ead50e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跑了多远，你也与我一起\n前进了多远……呵呵，我们\n究竟能走到多远的地方呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "606324c5bdd00a222897c1f94346d53a12318b7e7c090305a858eff72b8789d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03c7ef9dfc15217e13a1b37a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拍摄Q丸的广告，真的很新鲜。\n连零点一秒都要精益求精的\n世界……就像比赛一样呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68964efb99b91a84841aea9a4c4cbf4fbb22b0c80c8b785d4009edd88acb3fe7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35fa59e92ed3d48921a302dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然要回老家一趟，但我打算\n早点回来。可不能把时间\n全花在休息上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5a5002694c8057c39b9ff5e9c95a484f2ff202f58f5f46f5c502faf1ece4d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:628cb012fcdaa8b29667b1f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "粉丝来信似乎比平时更多了。\n大家温暖的心意……\n正一点点沁入心底。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43c75b4f7ad088bbf669b45d177afa8bf63d7c6afec251935d80979c05dc2b93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:126e2a9b32b55d5761e55492",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了布朗尼。\n反复练习过很多次，\n味道我很有信心哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03f911d1aaa24ca8fd162eb6cdf84622aa94871dde140deda62ef7c8ea55a1e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd0dbc64fdf476417201159f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向星星许愿固然美好，不过——\n让身心熊熊燃烧，成为\n星辰本身，不是更美妙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd05480ac8828e773143c7deeb1f2f116e39d5e68645cc6c12b5da96266b556d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c064627ede1f11cf5332739f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幽灵护士装……唉……\n你觉得呢？虽然是潘多拉同学的\n提议，但也未免太兴奋过头了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bc711360f5d6476d3e57c25b091f003fa266b9ce1249885fee4965c2bd0a055",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cc1e0dda10bc716291ab8b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "庆祝的气氛让赛道都\n空荡荡的呢。得趁现在赶紧跑！\n你当然也会来对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "73e676ee6c7092885c2425e388f30c5e3bf9261f021d915a6988ced1d811c348",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8542f46b1bcfb42dcd15aff9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练结束后能给我一点\n时间吗？我有东西想给你。\n…咦，你也有？是吗，好期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f07a15709f9bad3470db20051cce29971d11041f96d2d421d1fc001c5f5901c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24cdec7fda2a02e2b79b9d62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c328cf26a3fd5d995a83e439c1e6d7bf2c420c5f59add386c869518c1a236d8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40cdb0e9c5f9b955c41f1b4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "离新年还有一段时间呢。\n比赛也好学业也好私事也好，\n没做完的都得做完，全部！",
      "source_fingerprint": "831e640d7c4b41315f901ae9be518554c072c086d06c972c12494b133e8154b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:224016d2843fabe510f41710",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我准备了一份沐浴用品作为礼物。\n薄荷味的沐浴露，\n清爽舒适特别好用♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "939270093837df9802c1845d9dc167bf592b4c3a85abe809cc0111a8cd862862",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08eb540f39ab30a1db69062d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天……关于你自己的梦想，\n我想听听。只要我们两个人\n一起伸出手，就一定能够抓住它。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc9bef292501ed889ef9a7202e3351413f6881691206ab82182a95570d3663ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cc5187af473a54d37563076",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天潘多拉同学叫我过去一趟。\n好像要给我一个惊喜……呵呵，\n找我做什么我大概猜得到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b21ed312d153c9fffd3699137f8e7b07b640ee11cf6a31e22b048baaa7b61c8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4203d9689ab4fe12ef3e9f36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，没想到你把训练员室\n装饰了一番呢。今天的\n会议，看来会很有趣♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0a7483702d5d197dc6eddb31acdbfce3115724403cc6f2fc0fc088b77ed409d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eeef25a78c55a8f359d7505",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知呢。来，\n趁现在确认一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c94e1f60ecbf415f531d460a760f2d664e1d8b209bd937758083bee574c3be24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a926fa39228e83fbc569af5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了！\n开封看看，先确认一下\n里面是什么吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7288d46f189417f75e1846432a9333b651e877b7d55205bf23e94e156781bc35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:271edc50032a250980e395e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务成功！\n呵呵，不妥协的态度，\n我觉得很好哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7023e65c4ccf742f4b86ac984032f3ba5ead6a284eaba91d82f81c06d61628a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1358cebc834ebe7a583f94a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动快开始了呢。\n为了能以万全的状态参加，\n好好准备一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d0ce990e5ee13e0fbe674ebf60c410209c7e13f5fd1193d65522ea078bb250",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c171e4293247e8adeff9e2cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了呢。\n慢悠悠的话会赶不上的。\n好了，快走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1be87c0c498b0b2ee17df7d0f6b7c20150b70cebeb0496c9eaef2467ed371164",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:272ebf75a1551ca9133f6fd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…下次一定会赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "181f76090cc645ce2f189d629d218090c7682215d2f6d84b30e8c2992c63e825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cf92e59156e9a93e274a3df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了。\n是我们的成果呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7dbe846e4d6d38feec4b8685ad89636e0b9a2eae9d48c18e6ea0dd6a9a3719a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c9ab436a1179ea916264070",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢有存在感的单品。\n比如带有低调的装饰，或是材质\n挺括有型的那种……你明白吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d87cb0a6785f0b9a74042c303516fba0cfd8cc374859ccf29b3e1a68c7213169",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27f968709e88a4491bae1142",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紫丁的审美品位……果然很高呢。\n真的，给了我不少启发。\n我也得好好打扮才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31169919282e8c146334f765095b838f6688546ebdc4206ea9cd53a4b2986da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ac0ef536d111e7743ed81c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是不是戴了美瞳？经常有人这么\n问我。呵呵……这是天生的，\n是我引以为傲的眼睛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e602f947aa0a4a2872dd7887822e1382e0f0f2cd101a1c35ae24697e75df827f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f981831dff201773eb96846",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挺厉害……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e99841ee201750e4bb783df4a1970c85754342ca07753c1e00979aad98ce0e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:202d9847215e4c660eebf2e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正是想要的结果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7591692860ea6fcfbffad2b9692ea3c416e09e477656637e4031913ef2a99cca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:082e758611f04a8adfe566e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…下次一定会赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "181f76090cc645ce2f189d629d218090c7682215d2f6d84b30e8c2992c63e825",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc2a0060dd6786c54ae3d912",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挺厉害……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e99841ee201750e4bb783df4a1970c85754342ca07753c1e00979aad98ce0e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e13b4f816fc33a32a9480c97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刷新记录了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bb49e971cf2772b3c51dbe5b496c507924e9f42ff00e857cd470a9b9f26cedd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4e24c64980a02fcceab60af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都准备好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bd62305465b83e9e8f57e9731002c19939ec50ac4ee6b53b035815eaa94a9ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0fcacf3a3688ebca21446d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15ec886c37d09ec5d7b0a068",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，开始\n训练吧。\n为了下一次也能赢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a4b6acd6ffa19667fbfa8a3766c33c1a5fb979d2d8b7a1212e159b34fc51944",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66c75132d3536a4f38bf92db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要回顾一下？\n从过去中学习也很重要呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24dd54d836435e16f340f3f88fe104c0cdb078bd87d02b075b1fe0e2ff311059",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e9fcfdcf1ed6554679d549c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要开始比赛吗？\n好啊，我随时都\n准备好取胜了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75338033b79255ef529f90e7cc3c819f85370b8d2c9cb3c6ccb61e51047847cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c700e71bbce99c890c1110ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘，Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb83cf4ef414ba1498ca22eb71c89743df595040a09f9d503fb2e9db9beca0d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd122a4ec1453d894ce52a14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用这份力量，抓住胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed66903097d35962c3bbfb4ae6a0754e2c1c7fcfeca7ee8980af181aea6614bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecaeaad2ec727ac02eb367b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "主人公！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c9118088cfca81e63838fcdf989fa4958d9d2578d93ebb32750ac56db3395d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1254"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:006eaaa7b0b7c3ad4715af89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "后冠的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "492d77ab604558e4822b059cb8102af238c4a32c85a6a58d56d715b3f4e7b6ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1258"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f24d7fd212d8531dc2a9d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你见识一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c07f007c0e7fe1fde83c27ab934c5e0932fe99111fb606fe9498398b0d0f7dcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "1262"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2cd38704c330006f6dcb603",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31ad862afe505f7a0e3caf5d40108bddc33091f1c5054820028b7df74bd09a65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e83a27e83e0758cbb6ffcd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f6f9cb6d386b03a59eafb944e976a93775f81d43c59dffa89b8cc34793a942f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5165f96b47fcc1bb1c521ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，不错呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "649392e73a6a304828c768039e6b66e1c449d49519f9618a9bfd777e73dfe467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7de088da2325102b6e01468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edde3a8d21b92c27a5c507c923669ab158c7e313c638cf35c7fcfc2b08ad7741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:514dae0e756799075c8415e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太厉害了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34d1e940aec13dd525563c00293fe3cbcea3cb287332293cb503694c8ec17304",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
